# Upgrade to v1

The v1 provider uses protocol 6 and supports Terraform 1.5+ and OpenTofu 1.6+.
Resource schema versions remain zero, so no state migration is required.
Terraform/OpenTofu 1.12+ automatically persists resource identity metadata.
Legacy string imports remain supported; project-scoped resources use
`<project_id>/<resource_id>`.

